    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Negating and asking questions",
     "texto": [
      "Negation has two parts that surround the verb: **ne … pas**. **Je ne suis pas français** (I am not French). Before a vowel, **ne** drops its e: **Il n'est pas anglais**.",
      "There are two easy ways to ask a question. Raise your intonation at the end: **Tu es français ?** Or start with **Est-ce que**: **Est-ce que tu es français ?**"
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
